As a student, I want to search and filter meal-prep recipes by cost, ingredients, dietary restrictions, and cooking time, so that I can quickly find meals that fit my needs.
As a student, I want to create a weekly meal plan, so that I can organize what I will eat throughout the week.
As a student, I want to generate a grocery list with estimated costs from my meal plan, so that I know what ingredients to buy and can stay within my college budget.
As a gym attendee, I want to filter meals by nutritional information and set nutrition goals, so that I can choose meals that support my fitness goals and track my daily targets.
As a student, I want to adjust the number of servings for a recipe, so that I can prepare the right amount of food and avoid waste.
